{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras/e4f8d92b69a8c4997f2a75a78a295a5a.avif?t=1764026367\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras_big/e4f8d92b69a8c4997f2a75a78a295a5a.avif?t=1764026367 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imbued with access to super computers and quantum state manipulation.<br>Awaken as a prototype failsafe experiment unbeknownst as to its origin.\u00a0 Tasked with purging the corruption that has befallen the highly advanced civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras/dd56c26e744b63653b28a0f7e690dfc3.avif?t=1764026367\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras_big/dd56c26e744b63653b28a0f7e690dfc3.avif?t=1764026367 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape a mysterious abandoned laboratory.  <br>Manipulate, entangled quantum experiments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, shoot, explore, solve puzzles, backtrack and collect power ups.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your movement capabilities and traverse your surroundings with smooth, satisfying control\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sci-fi sound design </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 10 themed laboratory regions.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find mobility enhancements, blaster power-ups and key items to allow access to previously inaccessible areas.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot to kill a multitude of mutant threats and abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traps and maneuver through various hazards.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras/deab606adebb4d15343dbee5f201533b.avif?t=1764026367\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras_big/deab606adebb4d15343dbee5f201533b.avif?t=1764026367 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek to find 50 quantum computer access ports.\u00a0 Enter the quantum environment to manipulate blocks and particles tied to you own movements, destroy the particle experiments and disable each of the 50 quantum ports.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recover the data of each region by completing\u00a0quantum computer access ports to access the Boss Corruption for each region.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, unlock, access and destroy the Final Corruption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human made Sci-fi sound design tailored specifically for this game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3242500?t=1764026367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764026367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/40488f5a407ce8f476134b2c2d7165baf55dd487/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764026367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/40488f5a407ce8f476134b2c2d7165baf55dd487/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764026367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description"