raph\" >Shoot to kill a multitude of mutant threats and abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge traps and maneuver through various hazards.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras/deab606adebb4d15343dbee5f201533b.avif?t=1764026367\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/extras_big/deab606adebb4d15343dbee5f201533b.avif?t=1764026367 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek to find 50 quantum computer access ports.\u00a0 Enter the quantum environment to manipulate blocks and particles tied to you own movements, destroy the particle experiments and disable each of the 50 quantum ports.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Recover the data of each region by completing\u00a0quantum computer access ports to access the Boss Corruption for each region.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find, unlock, access and destroy the Final Corruption</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Human made Sci-fi sound design tailored specifically for this game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["James H. Van der Meulen"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242500/1697a66ce1d179c3334593964bf706fa7c57af40/header.jpg?t=1764026367","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This game was made with the intellectual property and creative assets created and owned by Artist, James H. Van der Meulen.<br />\r\nCopyright regarding the Art, Characters, World and Story of this Game belongs to James H. Van der Meulen.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3242500/704854503/c31c98687a41ba46bde9ecf0ba6